```
noRequireCatchParameter.invalid.js:29:10 lint/style/useErrorCause ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i The error is destructured in the `catch` clause.
  
    27 │ try {
    28 │   throw new Error("Original error");
  > 29 │ } catch ({ message }) {
       │          ^^^^^^^^^^^
    30 │   throw new Error(message);
